OL,3,GNEWSAAttack mum's trauma of fighting
OL,4,Aearly release plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe mother of a man stabbed to death in
OL,7,Fthe Nottingham attacks has cautiously
OL,8,Fwelcomed a change to the early prisoner
OL,9,Frelease scheme which should mean her
OL,10,Fson's killer will not now qualify.
OL,12,FThe plan to ease prison congestion had
OL,13,Finitially included those convicted of
OL,14,Fmanslaughter but, following a high
OL,15,Fprofile outcry, Prime Minister Andy
OL,16,FBurnham said this category of offender
OL,17,Fhad been ruled out.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,369,360,200,160,0,100
