OL,3,GNEWSAAttack mum's trauma of fighting
OL,4,Aearly release plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FBarnaby Webber was one of three people
OL,7,Fkilled by paranoid schizophrenic Valdo
OL,8,FCalocane in 2023. He was subsequently
OL,9,Fconvicted of manslaughter on the
OL,10,Fgrounds of diminished responsibility.
OL,12,FEmma Webber said while the change was
OL,13,F"the right thing", the families had
OL,14,Ffaced "trauma" to get this point.
